/T (Nails by Acacia makes use of a well-planned series of promotions and incentives aimed at attracting and retaining both customers and aspiring nail technicians. To encourage first-time visits, the salon provides a 5% discount to new clients, and a referral program rewards loyal customers with discounts when they refer friends or family. A loyalty card system provides regular customers with a 50% discount on nail services after every eight visits, thereby increasing repeat business. Students can benefit from early-bird discounts on nail training courses, making education more accessible. )
