/P 162 0 R
/T (Special promotions are also available during major holidays such as Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Easter, and Father's Day, which include themed nail designs, discounted packages, and gift vouchers. There are Seasonal promotions that focus on specific nail care needs or trends, such as moisturizing treatments in the winter, floral designs in the spring, warm colours in autumn or vibrant summer colours. To ensure a broad community reach, these targeted incentives are promoted both online and offline through social media and local flyers. Together, these promotions and incentives not only increase revenue but also help to build strong relationships with clients and learners, furthering the salon's mission of empowerment and employment. )
/E (Special promotions are also available during major holidays such as Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Easter, and Father's Day, which include themed nail designs, discounted packages, and gift vouchers. There are Seasonal promotions that focus on specific nail care needs or trends, such as moisturizing treatments in the winter, floral designs in the spring, warm colours in autumn or vibrant summer colours. To ensure a broad community reach, these targeted incentives are promoted both online and offline through social media and local flyers. Together, these promotions and incentives not only increase revenue but also help to build strong relationships with clients and learners, furthering the salon's mission of empowerment and employment. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [8]
>>
