/P 163 0 R
/T (To reach a larger market, Nails by Acacia will expand its services by offering mobile nail services, allowing clients to receive premium treatments in the comfort of their own homes, as well as retail sales of branded nail care products and supplies. The business will also enter the retail market by developing and selling its own branded nail care products, including cuticle oils, nail kits, hand creams, and press-on nail collections. To increase brand visibility and customer engagement, the business will expand its digital marketing strategy to include influencer collaborations, social media campaigns, and client referral programs. Future plans include opening new branches in underserved communities and providing franchise opportunities to graduates, allowing them to run their own salons under the Nails by Acacia brand. These growth initiatives position the company not only for profitability but also for long-term community impact. )
/E (To reach a larger market, Nails by Acacia will expand its services by offering mobile nail services, allowing clients to receive premium treatments in the comfort of their own homes, as well as retail sales of branded nail care products and supplies. The business will also enter the retail market by developing and selling its own branded nail care products, including cuticle oils, nail kits, hand creams, and press-on nail collections. To increase brand visibility and customer engagement, the business will expand its digital marketing strategy to include influencer collaborations, social media campaigns, and client referral programs. Future plans include opening new branches in underserved communities and providing franchise opportunities to graduates, allowing them to run their own salons under the Nails by Acacia brand. These growth initiatives position the company not only for profitability but also for long-term community impact. )
