/T (Nails by Acacia, which is already established as both a nail salon and a training centre that offers education and employment, intends to expand its market presence by capitalizing on its current strengths. The business intends to offer advanced and specialized courses in nail artistry trends, salon leadership, and entrepreneurship to help graduates become independent or open their own salons. Furthermore, Nails by Acacia intends to expand its job creation efforts by increasing training capacity and hiring more graduates in both internal positions and partner salons and spas throughout the region. )
