<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 169 0 R
/T (In December 2024, Nails by Acacia experienced limited revenue, earning only R20 000 overall, while operating expenses total is R65,000. This resulted in a net loss of R45 000, reflecting early-stage operational challenges. However, by December 2025, sales revenue had significantly increased to R250 000, indicating improved brand awareness and successful customer acquisition strategies. Operating expenses rose to R160 000 due to higher salaries, increased supply requirements, and expanded marketing efforts. Despite the higher expenses, the gross profit reached R160 000, demonstrating substantial improvement in financial performance.)
/E (In December 2024, Nails by Acacia experienced limited revenue, earning only R20 000 overall, while operating expenses total is R65,000. This resulted in a net loss of R45 000, reflecting early-stage operational challenges. However, by December 2025, sales revenue had significantly increased to R250 000, indicating improved brand awareness and successful customer acquisition strategies. Operating expenses rose to R160 000 due to higher salaries, increased supply requirements, and expanded marketing efforts. Despite the higher expenses, the gross profit reached R160 000, demonstrating substantial improvement in financial performance.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
