/Title (Nails by Acacia \(Pty\) Ltd is a dynamic and inclusive nail salon and training centre located in Dawn Park, Boksburg. The business offers a dual value proposition: professional nail care services and accredited training for aspiring nail technicians, with a strong focus on uplifting unemployed youth and women from surrounding townships like Rondebult.)
