/Title (Our core services include manicures, pedicures, acrylics, nail art, and custom press-on nails, alongside structured educational programs that provide hands-on skills, mentorship, and employment opportunities. With a start-up budget of R250,000, the business aims to operate sustainably by reinvesting profits into expansion, product development, and franchising. Nails by Acacia will implement targeted marketing strategies through social media, seasonal promotions, and partnerships, positioning itself as a leader in both beauty services and education within the nail care industry.)
