<<
/Title (Online marketing is an important part of the salon's strategy. Nails by Acacia promotes its services and training programs through social media platforms like Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok. These platforms allow the business to present nail designs, highlight student progress, share customer feedback, and interact directly with potential clients. Regular posts, stories, and short videos will increase visibility and interaction. A professional website will also allow for online bookings, provide information about services and training courses, and serve as an educational resource with blog posts, tutorials, and customer service tips. These digital efforts boost brand visibility and develop trust among a larger audience.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3113 0 R
